#USERS
### ListUsers
GET http://172.28.33.171:8080/users

### CreateUser
POST http://172.28.33.171:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name" : "God", "email" : "Starkov@god.com"}

### GetUserById
@id = 0
GET http://172.28.33.171:8080/users/{{id}}

### UpdateUser
PUT http://172.28.33.171:8080/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dmitriy",
  "email": "Dmitriy@go.com"
}

### DeleteUser
DELETE http://172.28.33.171:8080/users/1

### AssignRole
POST http://172.28.33.171:8080/users/7/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "moderator"
}

### RemoveRole
DELETE http://172.28.33.171:8080/users/7/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "role" : "moderator"
}

### ListPosts
GET http://172.28.33.171:8080/posts

### CreatePost
POST http://172.28.33.171:8080/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Пост Johna", "text": "Содержимое поста", "author_id": 5}

### GetPostById
@post_id = 6
GET http://172.28.33.171:8080/posts/{{post_id}}

### UpdatePost
PUT http://172.28.33.171:8080/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Обновлённый пост",
  "text": "Новое содержимое",
  "author_id": 1
}

### DeletePost
DELETE http://172.28.33.171:8080/posts/1

#COMMENTS
### ListComments
GET http://172.28.33.171:8080/comments

### CreateComment
POST http://172.28.33.171:8080/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"author_id": 3, "post_id": 2, "text": "Говно а не пост джон"}

### GetCommentById
@comment_id = 6
GET http://172.28.33.171:8080/comments/{{comment_id}}

### UpdateComment
PUT http://172.28.33.171:8080/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author_id": 1,
  "post_id": 1,
  "text": "Обновлённый комментарий"
}

### DeleteComment
DELETE http://172.28.33.171:8080/comments/11
X-User-ID: 7
